SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nJoin us for Food as Medicine\, a h
 ands-on experience where kids and their grown-ups explore seasonal\, nouri
 shing foods together with Rady Children’s Health.   \nTimes: 11am-12
 pm  \n*Please note programming lasts 10-30 minutes. \nHomemade gummy be
 ars with real fruits and veggies – and FIBER (no added sugars) \n\nLess
 on on Fiber \n\nAbout the Play Partner:\nRady Children’s Health (RCH)\,
  a premier pediatric healthcare system in Southern California\, unites the
  trusted expertise of Children’s Hospital of Orange County (CHOC)\, nati
 onally recognized for its commitment to safe\, high-quality care\, and Rad
 y Children’s Hospital San Diego\, ranked among the nation’s top 10 chi
 ldren’s hospitals by U.S. News &amp\; World Report. @chocchildrens \nI
 ncluded in museum admission. Space is limited! Book your tickets now. 
 \n*Members do not require a reservation.\n*Events and dates are subject to
  change. \nFrequently Asked Questions \nIs this program included with 
 museum admission?\nYes. Food as Medicine is included with regular museum a
 dmission. \nWill there be food samples?\nYes. Families will have the oppo
 rtunity to sample seasonal foods during the program. \nWhat kinds of acti
 vities will children explore?\nChildren may participate in sensory stati
 ons\, food demonstrations\, and hands-on activities focused on healthy eat
 ing and nutrition. \nWill recipes be available?\nYes. Families may receiv
 e recipes and ideas for easy\, nutritious meals and snacks they can make a
 t home.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/food-as-medicin
 e-with-rady-childrens-health-3/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/food-as-medicine-with-rady-children
 s-health-3/
