  Book your tickets now. \n*Members do not require a reservation.\n*Even
 ts and dates are subject to change. \nTIMES:\n\n11am– Happy Birthday 
 \n\n\n11:15 – Dance Party \n\n\n11:30pm – 12pm – Cake Distribution
  \n\n\n1:30pm &#8211\; Dance Workshop with Conga Kids \n\n\n2:30pm &#8
 211\; Line Dancing with Ms Cari \n\n&nbsp\;\nAbout the Play Partner 
 \nConga Kids is a nonprofit organization dedicated to promoting social and
