UID:bb4ae795d03912ce19bb2a3435540ac0@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nGet ready for a wild adventure! Joi
 n Doodlebugs Animal Adventures for an exciting live animal presentation fe
 aturing creatures from around the world.  \nTime: 11am-12pm\n*Please no
 te programming lasts 10-30 minutes. \nSpace is limited! Book your ticke
 ts now\; this program is included in museum admission.\nDisclaimer: *Event
 s and dates are subject to change.\n\nAbout the play partner:\nDoodlebugs 
 Animal Adventures offers educational LIVE animal presentations and story-t
 imes throughout Orange County and surrounding cities. With our hands-on ap
 proach to learning we encourage each child&#8217\;s innate sense of wonder
  about the world around them. With the help of our LIVE animal friends\, p
 articipants build empathy and a sense of connection with all living things
 . At Doodlebugs Animal Adventures we believe a curious mind can change the
  world. \nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nHow long is the program?\nThe li
 ve presentation lasts approximately 20 minutes\, followed by opportunities
  to meet some of the animals.\n\nWill children be able to touch the animal
 s?\nGuests will have the opportunity to touch certain animals following th
 e presentation.\n\nWhat animals will be featured?\nAnimal appearances may 
 vary\, but may include birds\, reptiles\, amphibians\, insects\, and mamma
 ls.\n\nIs this program included with admission?\nYes! This program is i
 ncluded with museum admission.\n\nDo I need to reserve a spot?\nSpace is 
 limited. We recommend booking your tickets in advance.\\n\\nMore info: htt
 ps://www.pretendcity.org/events/wild-about-animals-with-doodlebugs-animal-
 adventures/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/wild-about-animals-with-doodlebugs-
 animal-adventures/
